# Ananda Library Chatbot - Detailed File Reference

For project overview, see [AGENTS.md](mdc:AGENTS.md) in the repo root.

## Key File Paths (IDE Navigation)

### Frontend ([web/](mdc:web))

- **[web/src/app/](mdc:web/src/app)** - Next.js App Router pages and API routes
- **[web/src/pages/](mdc:web/src/pages)** - Next.js Pages Router (legacy endpoints)
- **[web/src/components/](mdc:web/src/components)** - Reusable React components
- **[web/src/hooks/](mdc:web/src/hooks)** - Custom React hooks
- **[web/src/utils/client/](mdc:web/src/utils/client)** - Client-side utilities
- **[web/src/utils/server/](mdc:web/src/utils/server)** - Server-side utilities
- **[web/src/services/](mdc:web/src/services)** - Firebase and external services
- **[web/__tests__/](mdc:web/__tests__)** - Jest/React Testing Library tests

### Data Ingestion ([data_ingestion/](mdc:data_ingestion))

- **[data_ingestion/pdf_to_vector_db.py](mdc:data_ingestion/pdf_to_vector_db.py)** - PDF processing
- **[data_ingestion/crawler/](mdc:data_ingestion/crawler)** - Web crawling system
- **[data_ingestion/audio_video/](mdc:data_ingestion/audio_video)** - Media transcription
- **[data_ingestion/utils/](mdc:data_ingestion/utils)** - Shared Python utilities
- **[data_ingestion/tests/](mdc:data_ingestion/tests)** - pytest test suite

### Configuration

- **[site-config/config.json](mdc:site-config/config.json)** - Site-specific settings
- **[site-config/prompts/](mdc:site-config/prompts)** - System prompts per site
- **[web/next.config.js](mdc:web/next.config.js)** - Next.js build configuration
- **[pyproject.toml](mdc:pyproject.toml)** - Python project configuration

### WordPress Integration

- **[wordpress/plugins/ananda-ai-chatbot/](mdc:wordpress/plugins/ananda-ai-chatbot)** - Plugin directory
- **[wordpress/plugins/ananda-ai-chatbot/secure-api-client.php](mdc:wordpress/plugins/ananda-ai-chatbot/secure-api-client.php)** - API client

## Site Configurations

Sites: `ananda`, `ananda-public`, `crystal`, `jairam`

Each has:

- Pinecone namespace in [site-config/config.json](mdc:site-config/config.json)
- System prompts in [site-config/prompts/](mdc:site-config/prompts)
- Environment file: `.env.[site]`
